也有一些進階技巧我希望你可以考慮實作:
1. Temperature tuning
Teacher temp often higher (softer targets)
Student temp learnable or fixed ~0.07
2. Cross-batch / memory bank distillation
Use large similarity matrix (important for CLIP)
Mimics large batch training
3. Hard negative emphasis
Weight high-similarity negatives more
Improves retrieval accuracy significantly
4. Intermediate feature distillation
Match transformer layers (especially for ViT)
Useful if architectures differ